<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ SCOREBOARD VS SRI LANKA IN ONE DAYER.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ SCOREBOARD VS SRI LANKA IN ONE DAYER.</headline>
<dateline>CHRISTCHURCH, New Zealand 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard</p>
<p>after New Zealand's innings against Sri Lanka in their day-night</p>
<p>limited over match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>New Zealand</p>
<p> B.Young b Zoysa				  21</p>
<p> N.Astle c Mahanama b Zoysa		   23</p>
<p> M.Horne b Muralitharan			 13 </p>
<p> S.Fleming run out				31</p>
<p> C.Cairns c Dharmasena b Jayasuriya	 27</p>
<p> A.Parore c and b Jayasuriya		  19 </p>
<p> C.Harris not out				 38</p>
<p> G.Larsen c de Silva b Muralitharan	 13</p>
<p> S.Doull c and b Jayasuriya		    1 </p>
<p> D.Vettori b de Silva			    4</p>
<p> H.Davis not out				   4 </p>
<p>  Extras (lb-1, nb-4, w-2)		     7</p>
<p>    Total (for nine wickets)		 201</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-39, 2-49, 3-68, 4-104, 5-134, 6-142,</p>
<p>7-157, 8-164, 9-170</p>
<p>Bowling: C.Vaas 7-0-45-0, N.Zoysa 7-1-29-2 (w-2),</p>
<p>K.Dharmasena 10-0-32-0, M Muralitharan 10-1-42-2, S Jayasuriya</p>
<p>10-0-26-3, U.Chandana 4-0-22-0 (nb-4), A de Silva 2-0-4-1.</p>
<p>Sri Lanka</p>
<p> S. Jayasuriya c Larsen b Harris		79</p>
<p> R. Kaluwitharana c Cairns b Harris	   15</p>
<p> R. Mahanama c Cairns b Larsen		   4</p>
<p> A. de Silva b Astle				66</p>
<p> A. Ranatunga not out			     19</p>
<p> H. Tillekaratne not out			  13</p>
<p>  Extras (b-1, nb-2, w-3)			  6</p>
<p>  Total (for four wickets)		     202</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-68, 2-73, 3-137, 4-183.</p>
<p>Did not bat: Upul Chandana, Kumar Dharmasena, Chaminda Vaas,</p>
<p>Muttiah Muralitharan, Nuwan Zoysa.</p>
<p>Bowling: S.Doull 5.5-1-38-0 (w-1), H.Davis 8-0-58-0 (2-w), C</p>
<p>Harris 10-0-38-2 (nb-2), G. Larsen 5-0-23-1, D Vettori 2-0-21-0,</p>
<p>N Astle 5-0-23-1.</p>
<p>Result: Sri Lanka won match by six wickets. Sri Lanka lead</p>
<p>two-match series 1-0.</p>
<p>Man of the match: S.Jayasuriya.</p>
</text>
